**/.DS_Store
**/.vscode/
**/target/
**/Cargo.lock
# The workspace-root lockfile is TRACKED: it is the reproducibility record for the
# frozen `days-legacy` baseline crate (legacy/README.md). Nested/worktree lockfiles
# stay ignored.
!/Cargo.lock
**/uv.lock
**/.lake/

# These are files related to logged outputs
**/*.csv
# ...with one exception: GeDES's own emitted flow table is E4's WORKLOAD DEFINITION, not a
# logged output. `configs/benchmarks/p12/e4_gedes_native_k32.toml` is generated from it and
# `tests/t21_p12_e4.rs` gates its md5, so a clone without it cannot build the fixture or run
# a single E4 test.
!/configs/benchmarks/p12/gedes_k32_seed41_flows.csv
# E5's per-flow protocol golden is an endpoint/work contract, not a logged measurement. The Full
# observation gate in `tests/t21_p12_e5.rs` regenerates and compares it byte-for-byte.
!/configs/benchmarks/p12/e5_wide_k32_q200_protocol_golden.csv
**/logs/**

# RepoPrompt
.repoprompt/**

# MkDocs build output
site/**
docs/site/**

# Leanguard
leanguard_corpus/**
